-- New model components: explicit pair projections and their defining equations.
ExteriorModel.Over.first: Ext
ExteriorModel.Over.second: Ext
ExteriorModel.Over.first-pair: Ext first
ExteriorModel.Over.second-pair: Ext second
ExteriorModel.Over.components: Ext first second
-- The existing iota homomorphism's laws are now named at its construction.
-- Its packaging decodes the algebra structure once; no downstream proof
-- is allowed to compute this bundled homomorphism to recover those laws.
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-add: Ext iota eadd
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-scale: Ext iota escale
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-mul: Ext iota emul
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-one: emb eone iota
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-hom: Alg algebra Lam Hom AlgHom isSet
ExteriorUniversal.Over.iota-eprod: Fin eprod emul
-- Extracting the exterior map's typed value necessarily identifies its
-- carrier with Ext. Law accessors perform this work at the same boundary.
-- phi is locked after phi-gen: neither phi nor ext may unfold here.
Determinant.Over.Map.value: Lam algebra AlgHom
Determinant.Over.Map.value-add: Lam algebra AlgHom Hom Ext eadd value
Determinant.Over.Map.value-scale: Lam algebra AlgHom Hom Ext escale value
Determinant.Over.Map.value-mul: Lam algebra AlgHom Hom Ext emul value
Determinant.Over.Map.value-one: Lam algebra AlgHom Hom value
Determinant.Over.Map.value-gen: Vec value
Determinant.Over.Map.value-eprod: Fin eprod emul
-- Existing Product no longer introduces another alias for the same map.
Determinant.Over.Product.phi-omega: Vec Mat std eprod Fin
Determinant.Over.Product.prod-eq: Vec Mat mmul Fin
